OL,3,GNEWSARingleader of global monkey
OL,4,Atorture network jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe ringleader of an international
OL,7,Fnetwork dedicated to torturing and
OL,8,Fkilling monkeys for entertainment has
OL,9,Fbeen jailed.
OL,11,FBartosz Poklek distributed "horrific"
OL,12,Fvideos which sold for hundreds of
OL,13,Fpounds and wrote scripts for how the
OL,14,Fanimals should be harmed and killed.
OL,16,FThe 30-year-old from Bexley in
OL,17,Fsouth-east London had admitted running
OL,18,Fa "large-scale monkey torture ring"
OL,19,Fbetween June 2023 and September 2025.
OL,20,FHe was sentenced to three years and
OL,21,Fthree months in prison at Woolwich
OL,22,FCrown Court.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,324,320,200,140,0,100
