OL,3,GNEWSARingleader of global monkey
OL,4,Atorture network jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It is no exaggeration to say that as a
OL,7,Flawyer or as a judge I have never
OL,8,Fencountered such a horrific case of
OL,9,Fanimal abuse in my life," Judge
OL,10,FChristopher Grout told the court.
